ay-label"}>{"Days 3–4"}</span>{"Seljalandsfoss and Skógafoss"}</h2><p>{"Base yourselves at a farm guesthouse between the two falls and visit each one twice: once at noon like everyone else, once at nine in the evening when the light goes gold and the car park empties."}</p><figure className={"custom-pull"}><blockquote>{"“At nine at night we had Skógafoss to ourselves. At noon we had shared it with two hundred people.”"}</blockquote></figure><p>{"Walk the first hour of the Fimmvörðuháls trail above Skógafoss. Twenty-two more waterfalls line the river, and almost nobody goes past the third."}</p><h2 id={"tb-day-5"} className={"page-nav-section"}><span className={"custom-day-label"}>{"Days 5–6"}</span>{"Vík and the black beaches"}</h2><p>{"Reynisfjara is beautiful and genuinely dangerous: the sneaker waves are real, so stay well back from the water line. Go at dawn, then drive ten minutes east to the quieter beach below Hjörleifshöfði."}</p><div className={"article-wide custom-pair"}><a href={"https://draftmango.com/framo/assets/media/placeholder/2560x1440.svg"} className={"glightbox"} data-gallery={"tb-article"} data-glightbox={"type: image; title: Reynisfjara at dawn"}><img src={"https://draftmango.com/framo/assets/media/placeholder/2560x1440.svg"} alt={"Basalt sea stacks off a black sand beach under a low grey sky"} width={"2560"} height={"1440"} loading={"lazy"} decoding={"async"} /></a><a href={"https://draftmango.com/framo/assets/media/placeholder/1200x1600.svg"} className={"glightbox"} data-gallery={"tb-article"} data-glightbox={"type: image; title: A turf church on the way east"}><img src={"https://draftmango.com/framo/assets/media/placeholder/1200x1600.svg"} alt={"A black wooden church with a turf roof in a green valley"} width={"1200"} height={"1600"} loading={"lazy"} decoding={"async"} /></a></div><h2 id={"tb-day-7"} className={"page-nav-section"}><span className={"custom-day-label"}>{"Days 7–9"}</span>{"Skaftafell: three nights, two glaciers"}</h2><p>{"This is the stretch where slowing down pays off. Book a guided glacier walk on Falljökull, then spend a free day on the loop to Svartifoss and the viewpoint at Sjónarnípa, where the whole glacier tongue opens below you."}</p><ul><li>{"Glacier walk with crampons: about $120 each, three hours."}</li><li>{"Svartifoss and Sjónarnípa loop: 4.5 miles, free, bring lunch."}</li><li>{"Fill the tank in Kirkjubæjarklaustur: the next pump is 45 miles away."}</li></ul><h2 id={"tb-day-10"} className={"page-nav-section"}><span className={"custom-day-label"}>{"Days 10–12"}</span>{"Jökulsárlón and the long way back"}</h2><p>{"Paddle among the icebergs in the morning, when the lagoon is still, then cross the road to Diamond Beach, where the ice washes up on the black sand. On the drive back west, stop at every waterfall you skipped on the way out."}</p><figure className={"article-wide custom-figure"}><img src={"https://draftmango.com/framo/assets/media/placeholder/1600x1067.svg"} alt={"Blue and white icebergs on the still water of the glacier lagoon"} width={"1600"} height={"1067"} loading={"lazy"} decoding={"async"} /><figcaption>{"Jökulsárlón at seven in the morning, before the boat tours start."}</figcaption></figure><h2 id={"tb-budget"} className={"page-nav-section"}><span className={"custom-day-label"}>{"The Budget"}</span>{"What two of us spent"}</h2><div className={"custom-table-wrap"}><table className={"custom-table"}><thead><tr><th scope={"col"}>{"Item"}</th><th scope={"col"}>{"For 12 days"}</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>{"Small car and full insurance"}</td><td>{"$1,140"}</td></tr><tr><td>{"Fuel, 560 miles"}</td><td>{"$310"}</td></tr><tr><td>{"11 nights, guesthouses and one cabin"}</td><td>{"$1,920"}</td></tr><tr><td>{"Food, mostly self-catered"}</td><td>{"$560"}</td></tr><tr><td>{"Glacier walk, kayak, pools"}</td><td>{"$350"}</td></tr></tbody><tfoot><tr><th scope={"row"}>{"Total for two"}</th><td>{"$4,280"}</td></tr></tfoot></table></div><p>{"The one thing we’d change: one fewer night in Vík, one more in Skaftafell. You’ll see."}</p></article><div className={"mt-14"}><div className={"flex flex-col gap-6 border-y border-default py-6 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between"}><div className={"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"}><span className={"mr-1 text-base font-semibold text-dark"}>{"Tags"}</span><a href={"#"} className={"tag"}>{"Iceland"}</a><a href={"#"} className={"tag"}>{"Road Trips"}</a><a href={"#"} className={"tag"}>{"Itineraries"}</a></div><div className={"social-share"} x-data={"{ copied: false }"}><span className={"social-share-label"}>{"Share"}</span><ul className={"social-list"} role={"list"}><li><button type={"button"} className={"social-link social-link--circle social-link--soft"} {...{"x-bind:aria-label": "copied ? 'Link copied' : 'Copy link'"}} aria-label={"Copy link"} {...{"x-on:click": "navigator.clipboard?.writeText(location.href); copied = true; setTimeout(() => copied = false, 1800)"}}><i className={"ph ph-link"} x-show={"!copied"} aria-hidden={"true"}></i><i className={"ph ph-check"} x-show={"copied"} x-cloak={""} aria-hidden={"true"}></i></button></li><li><a href={"#"} className={"social-link social-link--circle social-link--soft social-link--brand"} data-social={"x"} aria-label={"Share on X"}><i className={"ph ph-x-logo"} aria-hidden={"true"}></i></a></li><li><a href={"#"} className={"social-link social-link--circle social-link--soft social-link--brand"} data-social={"linkedin"} aria-label={"Share on LinkedIn"}><i className={"ph ph-linkedin-logo"} aria-hidden={"true"}></i></a></li><li><a href={"#"} className={"social-link social-link--circle social-link--soft social-link--brand"} data-social={"facebook"} aria-label={"Share on Facebook"}><i className={"ph ph-facebook-logo"} aria-hidden={"true"}></i></a></li><li><a href={"#"} className={"social-link social-link--circle social-link--soft"} aria-label={"Share by email"}><i className={"ph ph-envelope-simple"} aria-hidden={"true"}></i></a></li></ul></div></div>